.TH KOBAS 1 2000-1月 "kobas.fdr" "kobas.fdr"
.SH NAME
kobas.fdr \- Multiple testing correction of the p-values.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIkobas.fdr(\fBpvalue\fR as double, 
\fBmethod\fR as string = "BH");\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Multiple testing correction of the p-values.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBpvalue\fB \fR\- the raw p-values.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBmethod\fB \fR\- 
 the correction method: \fBBH\fR (Benjamini and Hochberg, default), \fBBY\fR
 (Benjamini and Yekutieli), \fBQVALUE\fR (Storey) or \fBNone\fR.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the adjusted p-values in the same order as the input.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
The q-value is estimated with a fixed lambda (0.5) of the Storey's pi0 estimator,
 the R \fBqvalue\fR package uses a smoothed lambda grid instead, so the result may
 differ slightly from the R package.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
KOBAS
.SH FILES
.PP
